  <h2 id="which">Which DBW Pedal Works With Holley?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Holley's GM LS drive-by-wire harness (<strong>558-406</strong>) is built for late GM <strong>6-pin</strong> throttle bodies and pedals: 2005–13 cars and 2007–13 trucks/SUVs.</li>
    <li>Pedals it lists: GM <strong>10379038</strong> and <strong>19417903</strong> (C6 Corvette), plus Holley's own <strong>145-160</strong> pedal, which is plug-and-play.</li>
    <li>It is <strong>not</strong> for older 8-pin pedals or 3-bolt throttle bodies (2006-and-earlier trucks, 2004-and-earlier cars).</li>
    <li>Holley lists this harness for the Terminator X <strong>Max</strong> and Dominator ECUs, so plan on a Max if you want drive-by-wire.</li>
  </ul>

